for many fashionistas the marquee at the  brandenburg gate is the emblem of berlin  fashion week with a steady stream of  designers and visitors coming and going  just a short walk away in the upscale  hotel de rome things are more relaxed  here at the vogue salon 10 designers and  fashion labels are presenting their  designs to a select audience from the  fashion world  the salon was set up for the first time  in the summer of 2011 by christiana arp  the editor-in-chief of vogue germany  it annoyed me to keep hearing that there  was no good fashion design in germany  i didn't want to agree  but i didn't want to keep preaching  our language is often visual so i  thought i'd create images that's the  basic idea of the vogue salon first and  foremost to create a meeting place  between designers and boutiques because  that's essential these young designers  have to be able to sell and to be able  to finance further collections  one of the buyers visiting the vogue  salon today is joseph polk owner of the  renowned berlin concept store the corner  he sells top class fashion by  international fashion labels such as  salon valentino or christian louboutin  the businessman always attends  christiana arp salon at the fashion week  it definitely simplifies things for us  particularly a business like ours which  purchases high class fashion  she has a great eye that saves us from  visiting lots of studios and looking at  lots of collections  because she's already gathered the best  of berlin creativity in this show  the vogue salon has already taken place  eight times at the hotel to rome  each one of the ten labels on show have  been hand-picked by cristiana arp  they will subsequently receive advice  and support over the course of four  seasons  the fashion has to be well tailored of  course but there are also other criteria  it has to touch me first of all  and it has to have something about it  where i can see that there's a strong  voice which might still be in need of  training  another criterion is that they dare to  say cristiana it's fine that you see  things like that as editor-in-chief of  vogue and that you give me advice but i  see things differently  great  they need that strength these young  people have to assert themselves  augustine  have managed that the berlin label is  showing its latest collection for autumn  winter 2015 not far from the vogue salon  the franco german design duo were vogue  salon proteges and their work is now  gaining international attention  i think it all started with you know us  being noticed by christina arbing being  part of the vox alone this is i think  where people started to consider our  work  a club  i think the important thing about the  vogue salon is that we got the vogue  stamp of approval  that creates a certain credibility  karen yesen is just embarking on her  career the 29 year old is making her  first appearance at the vogue salon with  her label bennu berlin this january  on the eve of the show she puts the  finishing touches to the designs in her  studio  caronyessen's fashion is made from used  jeans and old sofa leather  she's hoping to find the perfect  customer by a vogue salon  it makes  i want to appeal to the woman who is  conscious in two different ways  who's environmentally conscious but also  fashion conscious  and i think that's sometimes still  difficult with some of the other eco  labels that they don't bring these two  things together  berlin  is the first step into the world of  commerce karen yesen has two hours to  explain her concept to the buyers and  media representatives the young designer  is happy about the initial response  i have already got to know one or two  potential buyers who were very  interested  we'll talk about the details later  otherwise i'm still waiting to see what  happens because it's not over yet  arp's vogue salon is going down well  again this season her commitment to the  fashion industry is plain to see  the german fashion council has just been  set up an agency designed to raise the  profile of german fashion abroad with  christiana  as its patron
 

